{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01277","headline":"相和歌辞 决绝[词]三首 二 · 元稹","name":"相和歌辞 决绝[词]三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"噫春冰之将泮，何余怀之独结。\n有美一人，於焉旷绝。\n一日不见，比一日於三年，况三年之旷别。\n水得风兮小而已波，笋在苞兮高不见节。\n矧桃李之当春，竞衆人之攀折。\n我自顾悠悠而若云，又安能保君皓皓之如雪。\n感破镜之分明，覩泪痕之余血。\n幸他人之既不我先，又安能使他人之终不我夺。\n已焉哉！织女别黄姑，一年一度暂相见，彼此隔河何事无。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01277.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01277","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}